@startuml
title GeoMiniLM Next Development Cycle Roadmap

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Reviewer / Developer" as Developer

package "Next Development Cycle Priorities" as Priorities {
  component "1. Language Robustness\nparaphrase + shorthand + noisy prompts" as Language
  component "2. Multi-Step GIS Composition\ninputs + intermediate artifacts + outputs" as MultiStep
  component "3. Confidence and Abstention\nclarify, abstain, or proceed safely" as Abstention
}

package "Development Data and Coverage" as Development {
  database "Development Training Data\nstarter + expansion + new authored records" as DevData
  component "QGIS Production\nWorkflow Pack" as QGIS
  component "ParaView Scientific\nVisualization Pack" as ParaView
  component "Domain Workflow Packs\nflood, wildfire, planning,\nmonitoring, terrain" as DomainPacks
}

package "Governance Path" as Governance {
  database "Scenario-Grouped\nDevelopment Records" as GroupedData
  database "Grouped Holdout\nFamilies" as Holdouts
  component "Workflow-Only Scoring" as Scoring
  component "Route-Aware\nCalibration" as Calibration
  component "Candidate Lock\nretrieval + templates + routing\nconfidence + thresholds + floors" as CandidateLock
  component "One-Shot Frozen Gate\nformal production evaluation" as FrozenGate
  component "Gate Decision\nall conditions must pass" as GateDecision
  component "Deployment Eligible" as Eligible
}

package "Gate Conditions" as Conditions {
  component "Integrity and\nManifest Checks" as Integrity
  component "Duplicate and\nLeakage Checks" as Leakage
  component "Score Threshold\nrequired value 0.7600" as Threshold
  component "Configured\nConfidence Gate" as ConfidenceGate
  component "All-Record and\nCategory-Floor Gates" as CategoryGate
}

package "Current Production Status" as Status {
  component "Prime Deployment\ncurrently blocked" as PrimeBlocked
  component "Dashboard Integration\ncurrently blocked" as DashboardBlocked
  component "Failed Candidate\nnew development-only cycle" as FailedCandidate
}

Developer --> Language
Developer --> MultiStep
Developer --> Abstention

Language --> DevData
MultiStep --> DevData
Abstention --> DevData
QGIS --> DevData
ParaView --> DevData
DomainPacks --> DevData

DevData --> GroupedData : group related paraphrases\nand workflow variants together
GroupedData --> Holdouts : development split
Holdouts --> Scoring
Scoring --> Calibration
Calibration --> CandidateLock
CandidateLock --> FrozenGate : locked candidate only

FrozenGate --> Integrity
FrozenGate --> Leakage
FrozenGate --> Threshold
FrozenGate --> ConfidenceGate
FrozenGate --> CategoryGate

Leakage --> GateDecision
Threshold --> GateDecision
ConfidenceGate --> GateDecision
CategoryGate --> GateDecision
Integrity --> GateDecision

GateDecision --> Eligible : all conditions pass
GateDecision --> FailedCandidate : any gate fails
FailedCandidate --> PrimeBlocked
FailedCandidate --> DashboardBlocked

note right of Priorities
The next cycle should prioritize:
language robustness, multi-step GIS
composition, and confidence/abstention.
end note

note bottom of Development
Cross-cutting concerns for every pack:
- geospatial correctness
- artifact contracts
- recovery behavior
- cross-tool routing
end note

note bottom of FrozenGate
Frozen-set metrics and failed-record details
belong in the acceptance report, not in this
roadmap. Do not tune from frozen outcomes.
end note

note bottom of FailedCandidate
Failed production gates return to a new
development-only cycle. The frozen gate
does not feed examples, thresholds, or
template changes directly back into training.
end note

@enduml
